track cancerMutations
shortLabel Cancer Mutations
longLabel Somatic mutations in cancer
superTrack on
group phenDis

track cancerHotspots
parent cancerMutations pack
shortLabel Cancer Hotspots
longLabel Cancer Hotspots (cancerhotspots.org): amino acids that are mutated in cancer more often than expected by chance
type bigBed 12 +
bigDataUrl /gbdb/$D/cancerMutations/cancerHotspots.bb
itemRgb on
visibility pack
priority 3
mouseOver <b>${name}</b> ${hotspotType}, ${version}<br>${tumors} tumors, q-value ${qValue}<br>${topTissues}
skipFields score,strand,thickStart,thickEnd,reserved,blockCount,blockSizes,chromStarts,tissues,topTissues
skipEmptyFields on
urls transcript="https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Transcript/Summary?t=$$"
filterByRange.tumors on
filter.tumors 1:2175
filterValues.hotspotType single residue,in-frame indel,splice site
filterLabel.hotspotType Hotspot type
filterValues.version v2 (Chang et al. 2017),v3 (Bandlamudi et al. 2026)
filterLabel.version Hotspot release
filterValues.oncoKb yes,no
filterLabel.oncoKb In OncoKB
filterValues.tissues Lung,Bowel,Esophagus/Stomach,Uterus,Breast,Bladder,CNS/Brain,Skin,Head and neck,Prostate,Pancreas,Unknown,Kidney,Ovary/Fallopian tube,Soft tissue,Lymphoid,Liver,Blood,Biliary tract,Cervix,Thyroid,Testis,Adrenal gland,Bone,Ampulla of Vater,Thymus,Eye,Vulva/Vagina,Penis,Pleura,Peritoneum
filterType.tissues multipleListOr
filterLabel.tissues Cancer tissue
